{"id":12430,"date":"2025-03-13T13:37:11","date_gmt":"2025-03-13T13:37:11","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/nicoletcz.cz\/?p=12430"},"modified":"2025-03-13T13:37:11","modified_gmt":"2025-03-13T13:37:11","slug":"monitorovani-polymerni-extruze-v-realnem-case-pomoci-ramanova-spektroskopu-marqmetrix","status":"publish","type":"post","link":"https:\/\/nicoletcz.cz\/monitorovani-polymerni-extruze-v-realnem-case-pomoci-ramanova-spektroskopu-marqmetrix\/","title":{"rendered":"Monitorov\u00e1n\u00ed polymern\u00ed extruze v re\u00e1ln\u00e9m \u010dase pomoc\u00ed Ramanova spektroskopu MarqMetrix"},"content":{"rendered":"<p data-start=\"183\" data-end=\"493\">P\u0159i extruzi polymer\u016f doch\u00e1z\u00ed k z\u00e1sadn\u00edm zm\u011bn\u00e1m ve slo\u017een\u00ed a struktu\u0159e materi\u00e1lu, kter\u00e9 p\u0159\u00edmo ovliv\u0148uj\u00ed mechanick\u00e9 vlastnosti, stabilitu a kvalitu fin\u00e1ln\u00edho produktu. Tradi\u010dn\u00ed metody kontroly \u010dasto spol\u00e9haj\u00ed na vzorkov\u00e1n\u00ed a laboratorn\u00ed anal\u00fdzu, co\u017e znamen\u00e1 <strong data-start=\"439\" data-end=\"459\">\u010dasovou prodlevu<\/strong> a riziko vzniku vadn\u00e9 produkce.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"495\" data-end=\"862\">Raman\u016fv spektrometr <a href=\"https:\/\/nicoletcz.cz\/produkt\/marqmetrix-ail-in-one\/\"><strong data-start=\"495\" data-end=\"579\">MarqMetrix <\/strong><\/a>umo\u017e\u0148uje <strong data-start=\"597\" data-end=\"672\">kontinu\u00e1ln\u00ed, nedestruktivn\u00ed a vysoce p\u0159esn\u00e9 m\u011b\u0159en\u00ed p\u0159\u00edmo v m\u00edst\u011b v\u00fdroby<\/strong>. MarqMetrix dok\u00e1\u017ee v re\u00e1ln\u00e9m \u010dase detekovat chemick\u00e9 zm\u011bny v polymern\u00ed matrici a poskytuje okam\u017eitou zp\u011btnou vazbu pro optimalizaci v\u00fdrobn\u00edch parametr\u016f.<\/p>\n<figure id=\"attachment_12022\" aria-describedby=\"caption-attachment-12022\" style=\"width: 500px\" class=\"wp-caption aligncenter\"><img fetchpriority=\"high\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"wp-image-12022\" src=\"https:\/\/nicoletcz.cz\/app\/uploads\/2024\/03\/fe7c6a66-300x197.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"500\" height=\"329\" srcset=\"https:\/\/nicoletcz.cz\/app\/uploads\/2024\/03\/fe7c6a66-300x197.jpg 300w, https:\/\/nicoletcz.cz\/app\/uploads\/2024\/03\/fe7c6a66-768x506.jpg 768w, https:\/\/nicoletcz.cz\/app\/uploads\/2024\/03\/fe7c6a66.jpg 1024w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 500px) 100vw, 500px\" \/><figcaption id=\"caption-attachment-12022\" class=\"wp-caption-text\">Raman\u016fv spektrometr <a href=\"https:\/\/nicoletcz.cz\/produkt\/marqmetrix-ail-in-one\/\"><strong>MarqMetrix All-In-One<\/strong><\/a>: Kompaktn\u00ed a spolehliv\u00fd<\/figcaption><\/figure>\n<p>&nbsp;<\/p>\n<h2 data-start=\"864\" data-end=\"918\"><strong data-start=\"867\" data-end=\"916\">Pro\u010d pr\u00e1v\u011b Ramanova spektroskopie?<\/strong><\/h2>\n<ul data-start=\"920\" data-end=\"1774\">\n<li data-start=\"920\" data-end=\"1114\"><strong data-start=\"922\" data-end=\"964\">Online monitorov\u00e1n\u00ed chemick\u00e9ho slo\u017een\u00ed:<\/strong> Ramanova spektroskopie umo\u017e\u0148uje <strong data-start=\"999\" data-end=\"1042\">okam\u017eitou anal\u00fdzu molekul\u00e1rn\u00edch vibrac\u00ed<\/strong> a identifikaci polymern\u00edch struktur <strong data-start=\"1079\" data-end=\"1111\">bez nutnosti p\u0159\u00edpravy vzorku<\/strong>.<\/li>\n<li data-start=\"1115\" data-end=\"1286\"><strong data-start=\"1117\" data-end=\"1153\">P\u0159\u00edm\u00e1 integrace do v\u00fdrobn\u00ed linky:<\/strong> Syst\u00e9m MarqMetrix lze snadno p\u0159ipojit k extrud\u00e9ru a propojit s procesn\u00edm \u0159\u00edzen\u00edm, co\u017e umo\u017e\u0148uje automatizovanou kontrolu kvality.<\/li>\n<li data-start=\"1287\" data-end=\"1459\"><strong data-start=\"1289\" data-end=\"1326\">Bezpe\u010dn\u00e1 a nedestruktivn\u00ed anal\u00fdza:<\/strong> M\u011b\u0159en\u00ed prob\u00edh\u00e1 opticky <strong data-start=\"1352\" data-end=\"1395\">p\u0159\u00edmo p\u0159es ok\u00e9nko reaktoru nebo hadi\u010dku<\/strong>, \u010d\u00edm\u017e se minimalizuje riziko kontaminace \u010di ovlivn\u011bn\u00ed vzorku.<\/li>\n<li data-start=\"1460\" data-end=\"1637\"><strong data-start=\"1462\" data-end=\"1496\">Vysok\u00e1 citlivost a selektivita:<\/strong> MarqMetrix detekuje i drobn\u00e9 rozd\u00edly v chemick\u00e9m slo\u017een\u00ed, co\u017e pom\u00e1h\u00e1 identifikovat <strong data-start=\"1582\" data-end=\"1634\">p\u0159\u00edm\u011bsi, vedlej\u0161\u00ed reakce nebo degrada\u010dn\u00ed procesy<\/strong>.<\/li>\n<li data-start=\"1638\" data-end=\"1774\"><strong data-start=\"1640\" data-end=\"1668\">Sn\u00ed\u017een\u00ed odpadu a n\u00e1klad\u016f:<\/strong> D\u00edky okam\u017eit\u00e9 zp\u011btn\u00e9 vazb\u011b lze <strong data-start=\"1702\" data-end=\"1771\">eliminovat v\u00fdrobu nekvalitn\u00edch produkt\u016f a sn\u00ed\u017eit spot\u0159ebu surovin<\/strong>.<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<figure id=\"attachment_12029\" aria-describedby=\"caption-attachment-12029\" style=\"width: 500px\" class=\"wp-caption aligncenter\"><img decoding=\"async\" class=\"wp-image-12029\" src=\"https:\/\/nicoletcz.cz\/app\/uploads\/2024\/03\/c5597867-1-300x192.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"500\" height=\"321\" srcset=\"https:\/\/nicoletcz.cz\/app\/uploads\/2024\/03\/c5597867-1-300x192.jpg 300w, https:\/\/nicoletcz.cz\/app\/uploads\/2024\/03\/c5597867-1-768x493.jpg 768w, https:\/\/nicoletcz.cz\/app\/uploads\/2024\/03\/c5597867-1.jpg 1024w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 500px) 100vw, 500px\" \/><figcaption id=\"caption-attachment-12029\" class=\"wp-caption-text\">Raman\u016fv spektrometr <a href=\"https:\/\/nicoletcz.cz\/produkt\/marqmetrix-ail-in-one\/\"><strong>MarqMetrix All-In-One<\/strong><\/a> s m\u011b\u0159ic\u00ed sondou<\/figcaption><\/figure>\n<p>&nbsp;<\/p>\n<h2 data-start=\"1776\" data-end=\"1815\"><strong data-start=\"1779\" data-end=\"1813\">Aplikace spektrometru MarqMetrix v pr\u016fmyslu<\/strong><\/h2>\n<ul data-start=\"1816\" data-end=\"2166\">\n<li data-start=\"1816\" data-end=\"